CREATE TABLE "IntegrationConnection" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"agencyId" TEXT NOT NULL REFERENCES "Agency"("id") ON UPDATE RESTRICT ON DELETE RESTRICT,"provider" TEXT NOT NULL CHECK("provider" IN ('META','GOOGLE')),"accountId" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',"accountName" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',"currency" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',"timezone" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'SELECT_ACCOUNT',"credentials" TEXT NOT NULL,"expiresAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"revision" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,"lastSyncedAt" TIMESTAMP(3),"errorCode" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "IntegrationConnection_agencyId_provider_accountId_key" ON "IntegrationConnection"("agencyId","provider","accountId");
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "IntegrationConnection_id_agencyId_key" ON "IntegrationConnection"("id","agencyId");
CREATE TABLE "IntegrationAuthorization" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"agencyId" TEXT NOT NULL,"userId" TEXT NOT NULL,"provider" TEXT NOT NULL,"verifier" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',"expiresAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL);
CREATE INDEX "IntegrationAuthorization_expiresAt_idx" ON "IntegrationAuthorization"("expiresAt");
CREATE TABLE "IntegrationSyncRun" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"agencyId" TEXT NOT NULL,"connectionId" TEXT NOT NULL,"fromDate" TEXT NOT NULL,"toDate" TEXT NOT NULL,"status" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT 'RUNNING',"cursor" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',"staged" JSONB NOT NULL DEFAULT '[]',"revision" INTEGER NOT NULL,"leaseToken" TEXT NOT NULL,"leaseUntil" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL,"errorCode" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',"createdAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,"completedAt" TIMESTAMP(3),FOREIGN KEY("connectionId","agencyId") REFERENCES "IntegrationConnection"("id","agencyId") ON UPDATE RESTRICT ON DELETE RESTRICT);
CREATE INDEX "IntegrationSyncRun_agencyId_connectionId_createdAt_idx" ON "IntegrationSyncRun"("agencyId","connectionId","createdAt");
CREATE TABLE "AdDailyMetric" ("id" TEXT PRIMARY KEY,"agencyId" TEXT NOT NULL,"connectionId" TEXT NOT NULL,"day" TEXT NOT NULL,"campaignId" TEXT NOT NULL,"campaignName" TEXT NOT NULL,"adSetId" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',"adSetName" TEXT NOT NULL DEFAULT '',"spendMicros" BIGINT NOT NULL CHECK("spendMicros">=0),"impressions" BIGINT NOT NULL CHECK("impressions">=0),"clicks" BIGINT NOT NULL CHECK("clicks">=0),"currency" TEXT NOT NULL,"timezone" TEXT NOT NULL,"syncedAt" TIMESTAMP(3) NOT NULL DEFAULT CURRENT_TIMESTAMP,FOREIGN KEY("connectionId","agencyId") REFERENCES "IntegrationConnection"("id","agencyId") ON UPDATE RESTRICT ON DELETE RESTRICT);
CREATE UNIQUE INDEX "AdDailyMetric_dimensions_key" ON "AdDailyMetric"("agencyId","connectionId","day","campaignId","adSetId");
CREATE INDEX "AdDailyMetric_agencyId_day_idx" ON "AdDailyMetric"("agencyId","day");
